  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Correct statements for the given reaction are:</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0156_dd8ce7500f1c.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p>A. Compound &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&rsquo; is aromatic</p><p>B. The completion of above reaction is very slow</p><p>C. &lsquo;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&rsquo; shows tautomerism</p><p>D. The bond lengths of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> in compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> are found to be same</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below.</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "B, C and D only",
      "is_correct": false
